title Grid Zone Management Business Process

actor "Utility Operator" as UO
participant Camunda
participant VPPaaS
participant Kong
participant "Utility Operator Service" as Service

UO->Camunda: Fill Grid Zone data\n(utilityOperatorId, name, maxCapacity,\nboundaries, safetyThreshold, postalCode)
Camunda->VPPaaS: Request Grid Zone operation
activate VPPaaS
VPPaaS->VPPaaS: Verify if operation is possible\n(promise: true/false)

alt promise = true
  VPPaaS-->Camunda: Promise
  Camunda->UO: Confirm operation order\n(accept: true/false)
  UO->Camunda: Submit decision

  alt accept = true
    Camunda-->VPPaaS: Accept
    VPPaaS->Kong: POST/PUT/DELETE /GridZone
    Kong->Service: Forward Request
    activate Service

    note right of Service: Grid Zone operations:\n- Create zone under a UtilityOperator\n- Update maxCapacity, boundaries\n- Set safetyThreshold (kW stress limit)\n- Set postalCode (for neighbour detection)

    Service->Database: Read/Write GridZone data\n(gridZoneId, utilityOperatorId,\nmaxCapacity, boundaries,\nsafetyThreshold, postalCode)
    Database-->Service: Result
    Service-->Kong: Response
    deactivate Service
    Kong-->VPPaaS: Response
    VPPaaS-->Camunda: Declare (done)
  else accept = false
    Camunda-->VPPaaS: Decline
    note right of VPPaaS: Operation cancelled — data unchanged
  end

else promise = false
  VPPaaS-->Camunda: Decline
  Camunda->UO: Decide what to do next\n(retry or abort)
end
deactivate VPPaaS
